                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 12,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans just passed a 1000-page bill in the dead of night that strips health care and takes food off the tables of New Mexicans\u2014all to hand billionaires another tax break.\n\nIt will raise costs, close hospitals, and hurt our families.\n\nI voted NO. New Mexico deserves better.",
