                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Rural hospitals like Socorro General are lifelines for Southern New Mexico. I sat down with physicians and hospital administrators to hear firsthand what's at stake: Medicaid cuts that could shutter their doors and make it harder for expectant mothers and babies to get care they need. We talked about the urgent need to protect Medicaid funding and keep rural hospitals open. If these services disappear, people will die, and surrounding communities will suffer.",
