                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "New Mexico providers agree:\nHospitals will close, hundreds of thousands of New Mexicans will lose healthcare, and Rural and Tribal communities will bear the brunt of the Republican reconciliation bill. Yesterday, I brought providers across the healthcare spectrum together to discuss the unprecedented cuts to Medicaid, and the devastating impact they would have on our state. This bill is cruel, and grows the debt by trillions, while destroying our healthcare system and giving away trillions to buillionaires. I'm fighting in Congress to stop this Big Ugly Bill and protect access and quality of care for all New Mexicans.",
                "text_lang": "en",
